{"product_id":"grappleberry-i-love-salts","title":"Grappleberry by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI Love Salts Grappleberry is a potent mashup of some of the most delicious fruit flavors you can think of. Plump purple grapes, shiny red apples, and tart handfuls of blueberries mingle to make a one-of-a-kind nicotine salt e-juice flavor that’s hard to stop vaping. The intense fruit flavors in I Love Salts Grappleberry stay well-balanced throughout each inhale, allowing your tastebuds to savor the sweet essence of crisp apples, freshly picked grapes and ripe blueberries.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Grappleberry E-Juice is part of Mad Hatter Vapes’ new I Love Salts line, which is made up of nicotine salt e-liquids infused with inventive flavors. You can get a bottle in 25 mg or 50 mg, depending on the nicotine strength you prefer. I Love Salts juices are best used with a vape pod system and should never be used with a sub-ohm system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet a grip on I Love Salts Grappleberry ASAP!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"I love salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Nic salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003enic salts\u003c\/a\u00